# Money
An amount as dollars and cents:  12.5 is "$12.50".

<spell>
	to write (amount as a number) as money:
		set cents to round (amount * 100)
		set dollars to (cents / 100) as an integer
		set left over to cents - dollars * 100
		if left over < 10 return "$" + dollars + ".0" + left over
		return "$" + dollars + "." + left over

	to test money
		write 12.5 as money should be "$12.50"
		write 3.07 as money should be "$3.07"
		write 0 as money should be "$0.00"
</spell>
